### Work Orders - List all work orders
GET http://localhost:7071/api/v1/work-orders
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

### Work Orders - Get work order by ID
GET http://localhost:7071/api/v1/work-orders/1
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

### Work Orders - Create work order
POST http://localhost:7071/api/v1/work-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "mechanicId": 2,
  "status": "Recepción",
  "services": ["Cambio de aceite", "Alineación"],
  "gases": true,
  "escaner": false,
  "observations": "Revisión general y diagnóstico previo",
  "diagnosis": "Motor funcionando correctamente",
  "deliveryDate": "2026-06-10",
  "garantia": 90,
  "total": 120000
}

### Work Orders - Update work order
PUT http://localhost:7071/api/v1/work-orders/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

{
  "status": "Diagnóstico",
  "services": ["Cambio de aceite", "Frenos"],
  "diagnosis": "Se requiere cambio de pastillas de freno",
  "total": 145000
}

### Work Orders - Delete work order
DELETE http://localhost:7071/api/v1/work-orders/1
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

